          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Discuss with elders in your community what units were used for measurement of length in the olden days. Also, using the internet, try to find out about the length scales found in excavations of archaeological sites in India."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.083,
            0.157,
            0.247,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
